# Firebase Authentication Configuration
# Obtain these credentials from your Firebase Console (Project Settings > General > Your apps / Web app)
FIREBASE_API_KEY=your_firebase_web_api_key_here
FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=your-project-id.firebaseapp.com
FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=your-project-id

# Instructions:
# 1. Go to https://console.firebase.google.com/ and create or select a project.
# 2. Navigate to "Authentication" > "Sign-in method" and enable "Email/Password".
# 3. Copy your Web API Key and Project ID into this file and rename it to .env.
